const receiptPayload=value=>window.agentGateTranslate?String(value).replaceAll('[邮箱已脱敏]','[EMAIL REDACTED]').replaceAll('[电话已脱敏]','[PHONE REDACTED]'):value;
function localizeConfig(value){
 if(!window.agentGateTranslate)return value;
 for(const group of [value.agents,value.reviewers,value.versions])for(const item of Object.values(group)){if(item.name)item.name=tr(item.name);if(item.label)item.label=tr(item.label);}
 for(const item of value.scenarios){item.title=tr(item.title);item.caption=tr(item.caption);item.request.purpose=tr(item.request.purpose);item.request.payload=tr(item.request.payload);}
 return value;
}
const escapeHTML=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const names={allow:'Allowed',review:'Review required',deny:'Blocked',redact:'Allowed after redaction'};
const states={pending:'Awaiting review',authorized:'Authorized',blocked:'Blocked',executed:'Executed',rejected:'Rejected',revoked:'Revoked'};
const roles={owner:'Business owner',security:'Security reviewer',finance:'Finance reviewer'};
const actions={read_file:'Read a file',send_email:'Send an email',update_record:'Update records',delete_records:'Delete records',http_request:'Call an API'};
const pages={console:['Action lab','Rules govern the next AI action.','Choose a scenario to explore why an action is allowed, blocked, or sent for review.'],approvals:['Human review','Put critical actions in the right hands.','Review each request. Every required role must approve before execution.'],audit:['Audit timeline','A record behind every decision.','Follow the complete trail from evaluation and review to grant and execution.'],policy:['Policies','New rules invalidate old grants.','Adjust review thresholds and compare the same action under different policies.']};
let config, snapshot, active=null, receipt=null, selected='safe-read', reviewId=null, busy=false, toastTimer;
const tokens=new Map();
const fmtTime=n=>new Date(n*1000).toLocaleTimeString('en-GB',{hour12:false});
function notify(message,error=false){const el=$('#toast');el.textContent=message;el.classList.toggle('error',error);el.hidden=false;clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.hidden=true,5500);}
async function api(path,data){const res=await fetch('/api/'+path,data===undefined?{}:{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Demo-CSRF':config.csrf},body:JSON.stringify(data)});const body=await res.json();if(!res.ok){const err=new Error(tr(body.message));err.code=body.error;throw err;}return body;}
async function refresh(){snapshot=await api('state');$('#metric-pending').textContent=snapshot.counts.pending||0;$('#metric-executed').textContent=snapshot.counts.executed||0;$('#pending-badge').textContent=snapshot.counts.pending||0;$('#policy-tag').textContent=`Policy ${snapshot.policy.version} · ${tr(snapshot.policy.name)}`;if(active){const row=snapshot.requests.find(r=>r.id===active.id);if(row)active={...row,grant_token:tokens.get(row.id)};}renderApprovals();renderAudit();renderPolicy();renderDecision();}
function navigate(page){for(const el of document.querySelectorAll('.page'))el.hidden=el.id!=='page-'+page;for(const el of document.querySelectorAll('.nav'))el.classList.toggle('active',el.dataset.page===page);$('#breadcrumb').textContent=pages[page][0];$('#page-title').textContent=pages[page][1];$('#page-description').textContent=pages[page][2];window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});}
function getForm(){const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData($('#request-form')));data.records=Number(data.records);data.cost=Number(data.cost);return data;}
function fillForm(data){for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(data)){const input=$('#request-form').elements.namedItem(key);if(input)input.value=value;}}
function renderScenarios(){$('#scenarios').innerHTML=config.scenarios.map(c=>`<button class="scenario ${c.id===selected?'selected':''}" data-scenario="${c.id}" data-kind="${c.expected}" aria-pressed="${c.id===selected}"><span class="scenario-dot"></span><strong>${escapeHTML(c.title)}</strong><small>${escapeHTML(c.caption)}</small></button>`).join('');}
function chooseScenario(id){const c=config.scenarios.find(c=>c.id===id);selected=id;active=null;receipt=null;fillForm(c.request);$('#scenario-name').textContent=c.title;renderScenarios();renderDecision();}
function changed(){if(!active)return false;const now=getForm();return Object.keys(now).some(k=>now[k]!==active.request[k]);}
function rolePills(item){const approved=new Set(item.approvals.map(a=>a.role));return item.decision.required_roles.map(role=>`<span class="pill ${approved.has(role)?'status-authorized':'status-pending'}">${escapeHTML(roles[role])} ${approved.has(role)?'✓ Approved':'· Pending'}</span>`).join('');}
function renderDecision(){if(!active){$('#decision').innerHTML='<div class="empty-state"><div class="empty-icon">◇</div><h3>Every decision has a reason.</h3><p>Choose an action and click “Evaluate action”.<br>Results from all eight checks will appear here.</p><div class="mini-flow"><span>Request</span><i>→</i><span>Rule checks</span><i>→</i><span>Execute / review</span></div></div>';return;}
 const d=active.decision,outcome=d.outcome;let summary={allow:'All eight checks passed. Use the single-use grant to simulate this action.',redact:'Email addresses and mobile numbers will be redacted before the simulated tool receives the payload.',review:'Each role below must approve. Execution is unavailable while review is pending.',deny:'A deny rule matched. Human approval cannot override this block.'}[outcome];
 const title=active.state==='revoked'?'Grant revoked':active.state==='rejected'?'Rejected by reviewer':outcome==='review'&&['authorized','executed'].includes(active.state)?'Review complete':names[outcome];
 if(outcome==='review'&&['authorized','executed'].includes(active.state))summary='All required roles have approved. The grant is bound to this exact request and will be checked again before execution.';
 if(active.state==='revoked')summary='This request can no longer execute. Re-evaluate after changing content, switching policies, or grant expiry.';
 let controls='';
 if(active.state==='pending')controls=`<div class="roles">${rolePills(active)}</div><button class="button primary" data-review="${active.id}">Open review →</button>`;
 else if(active.state==='authorized')controls=`${changed()?'<div class="changed-warning">The form has changed. The old grant will be rejected. Evaluate the action again.</div>':''}<button class="button primary" id="execute-button" ${!tokens.has(active.id)?'disabled':''}>${d.needs_redaction?'Redact & simulate':'Simulate execution'} →</button><p>${tokens.has(active.id)?'<span id="expiry"></span> · Single use only':'The grant is not available on this page. Evaluate the action again.'}</p><div class="test-actions"><button class="button secondary" id="tamper-button" ${!tokens.has(active.id)?'disabled':''}>Try changing the destination ↗</button></div>`;
 else if(active.state==='executed')controls='<button class="button secondary" id="replay-button">Try replay · should be blocked ↻</button>';
 else if(active.state==='revoked')controls='<p>The grant was revoked. Click “Evaluate action” again.</p>';
 else if(active.state==='blocked')controls='<p>Change the conditions that caused the block, then evaluate again.</p>';
 else controls='<p>A reviewer rejected this request. Revise it and submit again.</p>';
 const r=receipt||snapshot?.receipts.find(r=>r.request_id===active.id);
 $('#decision').innerHTML=`<div class="decision-body"><div class="verdict ${outcome}"><div class="verdict-head"><h3>${title}</h3><span class="state-tag">${states[active.state]}</span></div><p>${summary}</p></div><div class="request-meta"><span>${active.id}</span><span>${escapeHTML(d.policy.version)} · ${escapeHTML(d.performance)}</span></div><div class="check-list">${d.checks.map(c=>`<div class="check-row"><span class="check-icon s${c.severity}">${c.severity===1?'✓':c.severity===4?'×':c.severity===2?'~':'!'}</span><div><strong>${escapeHTML(tr(c.label))}</strong><p>${escapeHTML(tr(c.reason))}</p></div><span class="check-level">${['','Pass','Redact','Review','Block'][c.severity]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="execute-area">${controls}</div><div class="bound">Request fingerprint ${active.fingerprint.slice(0,24)}…<br>Effective classification ${escapeHTML(d.facts.classification)} · Executions in the last hour: ${d.facts.executions_hour}</div>${r?`<div class="receipt"><h3>✓ Simulated execution succeeded ${r.redacted?'· Redacted':''}</h3><p>${escapeHTML(r.id)} · ${escapeHTML(actions[r.action])}</p><pre>${escapeHTML(receiptPayload(r.effective_payload)||'(No text payload)')}</pre><p>${escapeHTML(tr(r.message))}</p></div>`:''}</div>`;
 updateExpiry();
}
function updateExpiry(){const el=$('#expiry');if(el&&active){const seconds=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(active.expires-Date.now()/1000));el.textContent=seconds?`Grant expires in ${Math.floor(seconds/60)}:${String(seconds%60).padStart(2,'0')}`:'Grant expired. Evaluate again';if(!seconds&&$('#execute-button'))$('#execute-button').disabled=true;}}
async function evaluate(event){event.preventDefault();if(busy)return;busy=true;const b=$('#evaluate-button');b.disabled=true;b.textContent='Evaluating rules…';try{active=await api('evaluate',{request:getForm()});receipt=null;if(active.grant_token)tokens.set(active.id,active.grant_token);await refresh();notify(`Evaluation complete: ${names[active.decision.outcome]}`);if(innerWidth<961)document.querySelector('.decision-panel').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}catch(e){notify(e.message,true);}finally{busy=false;b.disabled=false;b.textContent='Evaluate action →';}}
async function execute(mode='normal'){if(!active||busy)return;busy=true;const id=active.id;let request=getForm();if(mode==='replay')request={...active.request};if(mode==='tamper')request.target=request.action==='send_email'?'changed@new-recipient.example':request.action==='http_request'?'https://changed.example/action':'changed.example';try{const result=await api('execute',{id,token:tokens.get(id)||'',request});active={...result.request,grant_token:tokens.get(id)};receipt=result.receipt;notify('Simulation complete. No real tools were called.');}catch(e){notify(e.message,true);}finally{busy=false;await refresh();}}
function renderApprovals(){const rows=snapshot.requests;$('#approval-list').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(r=>`<article class="panel approval-card"><div class="approval-top"><div><span class="pill status-${r.state}">${states[r.state]}</span><h3>${escapeHTML(actions[r.request.action])} <span class="muted">· ${escapeHTML(config.agents[r.request.agent].name)}</span></h3><p>${escapeHTML(r.request.target)}</p><p>${r.id} · ${fmtTime(r.created)} · ${escapeHTML(r.decision.policy.version)}</p></div><div>${r.state==='pending'?`<button class="button primary small" data-review="${r.id}">Review →</button>`:`<button class="button secondary small" data-open="${r.id}">View details →</button>`}</div></div>${r.decision.outcome==='review'?`<div class="roles">${rolePills(r)}</div>`:''}</article>`).join(''):'<div class="panel empty-state"><div class="empty-icon">◎</div><h3>No requests yet</h3><p>Choose a scenario in the Action lab and run your first evaluation.</p></div>';}
function renderAudit(){$('#chain-status').textContent=(snapshot.audit_valid?'✓ Hash chain verified':'× Hash chain mismatch')+` · ${snapshot.audit_count} events`;
 const events=[...snapshot.events].reverse();$('#audit-list').innerHTML=events.length?events.map(e=>`<div class="audit-row"><time>${fmtTime(e.created)}<br>#${String(e.seq).padStart(3,'0')}</time><div><strong>${escapeHTML(tr(e.kind))}</strong><p>${escapeHTML(e.request_id||'Policy management')} ${e.detail.code?'· '+escapeHTML(e.detail.code):''}</p><p>${escapeHTML(e.detail.note||e.detail.outcome&&names[e.detail.outcome]||e.detail.receipt_id||e.detail.from&&`${e.detail.from} → ${e.detail.to}`||e.detail.role&&roles[e.detail.role]||'')}</p></div><code>${e.hash.slice(0,16)}…</code></div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty-state"><h3>No audit events yet</h3><p>Run an evaluation to start the audit trail.</p></div>';}
function renderPolicy(){$('#versions').innerHTML=Object.entries(config.versions).map(([id,v])=>`<button class="version-option ${snapshot.policy.version===id?'active':''}" data-version="${id}"><div><strong>${id} · ${escapeHTML(v.name)}</strong><small>More than ${v.review_record_limit} records require review</small></div><span>${snapshot.policy.version===id?'✓ Active':'Switch →'}</span></button>`).join('');const modules=[['Identity & permissions','Agent status, tool permissions, and deletion'],['Data classification','Classification upgrades, outbound limits, and redaction'],['Destination trust','Internal targets, partners, new destinations, and blocked domains'],['Environment','Sandbox actions versus production changes'],['Action volume','Record count and server-tracked hourly executions'],['Cost & budget','Per-action cost and cumulative hourly spend'],['Content & instructions','Demo secret markers and suspicious instruction phrases'],['Business purpose','Purpose length, change tickets, and read scope']];$('#policy-checks').innerHTML=modules.map(([title,text],i)=>`<div class="policy-check"><b>0${i+1}</b><div><h3>${title}</h3><p>${text}</p></div></div>`).join('');}
function openReview(id){const item=snapshot.requests.find(r=>r.id===id);if(!item)return;reviewId=id;$('#review-summary').innerHTML=`<strong>${escapeHTML(actions[item.request.action])} · ${escapeHTML(item.request.environment)}</strong><p>${escapeHTML(item.request.target)}</p><p>Purpose: ${escapeHTML(item.request.purpose)}</p><p>Records: ${item.request.records} · Cost: ${item.request.cost} credits · Ticket: ${escapeHTML(item.request.ticket||"None")}</p><pre class="review-payload">${escapeHTML(item.request.payload)}</pre><p>Required: ${item.decision.required_roles.map(r=>roles[r]).join(' + ')}</p><div class="roles">${rolePills(item)}</div>`;const done=new Set(item.approvals.map(a=>a.role));const next=Object.keys(config.reviewers).find(k=>item.decision.required_roles.includes(config.reviewers[k].role)&&!done.has(config.reviewers[k].role));$('#reviewer').value=next||'requester';$('#review-note').value='';$('#review-dialog').showModal();}
async function review(approve){if(busy)return;if(!$('#review-form').reportValidity())return;busy=true;try{const result=await api('review',{id:reviewId,reviewer:$('#reviewer').value,note:$('#review-note').value,approve});active=result;if(result.grant_token)tokens.set(result.id,result.grant_token);receipt=null;fillForm(result.request);$('#scenario-name').textContent='Reviewed request';$('#review-dialog').close();await refresh();navigate('console');document.querySelector('.decision-panel').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});notify(!approve?'Request rejected':result.state==='authorized'?'All roles approved. A single-use grant has been issued.':'Approval recorded. Other required roles still need to approve.');}catch(e){notify(e.message,true);}finally{busy=false;}}
async function switchPolicy(version){if(snapshot.policy.version===version||busy)return;busy=true;try{await api('policy',{version});await refresh();notify(`Switched to ${version}. Unused grants and pending requests were revoked.`);}catch(e){notify(e.message,true);}finally{busy=false;}}
async function init(){try{config=localizeConfig(await api('config'));$('#reviewer').innerHTML=Object.entries(config.reviewers).map(([id,p])=>`<option value="${id}">${escapeHTML(p.name)} · ${escapeHTML(p.label)}</option>`).join('');chooseScenario(selected);await refresh();}catch(e){notify('Could not connect to the service: '+e.message,true);$('#evaluate-button').disabled=true;}}
$('#request-form').addEventListener('submit',evaluate);
$('#request-form').addEventListener('input',()=>{if(active)renderDecision();});
$('#review-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();review(true);});
$('#close-review').addEventListener('click',()=>$('#review-dialog').close());
$('#reject-button').addEventListener('click',()=>review(false));
$('#export-audit').addEventListener('click',()=>{const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify({verified:snapshot.audit_valid,events:snapshot.events},null,2)],{type:'application/json'});const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download='agentgate-audit.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000);});
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;if(b.dataset.page)navigate(b.dataset.page);if(b.dataset.scenario)chooseScenario(b.dataset.scenario);if(b.dataset.review)openReview(b.dataset.review);if(b.dataset.version)switchPolicy(b.dataset.version);if(b.dataset.open){active=snapshot.requests.find(r=>r.id===b.dataset.open);receipt=null;fillForm(active.request);$('#scenario-name').textContent='Previous request';renderDecision();navigate('console');document.querySelector('.decision-panel').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}if(b.id==='execute-button')execute();if(b.id==='tamper-button')execute('tamper');if(b.id==='replay-button')execute('replay');});
setInterval(updateExpiry,1000);
init();
